OL,3,GNEWSARestrictions in place after
OL,4,Aanother bird flu case
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother case of bird flu has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed in Lincolnshire.
OL,9,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,10,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said an
OL,11,Foutbreak of the avian influenza H5N1
OL,12,Fwas found in commercial poultry near
OL,13,FConingsby in East Lindsey.
OL,15,FA 1.9 miles (3km) protection zone and
OL,16,F6.2 miles (10km) surveillance zone have
OL,17,Fbeen declared around the site and all
OL,18,Fbirds will be humanely culled, Defra
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
