OL,3,GNEWSARestrictions in place after
OL,4,Aanother bird flu case
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the fourth outbreak reported in
OL,7,FEast Yorkshire and Lincolnshire this
OL,8,Fmonth, with cases reported in the
OL,9,FBrigg, Pocklington and Market Rasen
OL,10,Fareas.
